"<p>Mỗi template marketplace là một thư mục độc lập nằm tại <code>templates/&#x3C;id>/</code> (<code>&#x3C;id></code> khớp <code>^[a-z0-9-]+$</code>). Thêm một template mới chỉ cần thêm thư mục và fixture kiểm thử offline — không cần sửa mã nguồn ứng dụng.</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>templates/&#x3C;id>/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  template.toml        # Bắt buộc: metadata, nguồn phiên bản, biến, tên miền, health, backup, security</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  docker-compose.yml   # Tùy chọn: dùng khi không thiết lập source.path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  overlay.yml          # Tùy chọn: hợp nhất sâu (deep-merge) lên file compose trước khi Nitrobase biến đổi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  logo.svg             # Tùy chọn: biểu tượng hiển thị trên marketplace</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Ví dụ <code>template.toml</code></h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-toml\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pocketbase\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PocketBase\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">description = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A one-file backend: realtime database, auth, file storage and admin dashboard.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">category = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"backend\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">website = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://pocketbase.io\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">docs = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://pocketbase.io/docs/\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tags = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"database\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auth\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">min_docker_version = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"20.10\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">notes = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Admin superuser is created on first start.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">source</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">repo = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pocketbase/pocketbase\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">versions = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"releases\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # \"releases\" | \"tags\" | \"commits\" | \"branches\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">version_prefix = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">version_filter = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'^v\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+$'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Tùy chọn khi kéo file compose từ repo gốc:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># path = \"docker\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># compose = \"docker-compose.yml\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># env_defaults = \".env.example\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># include = [\"docker-compose.yml\", { path = \"init.sh\", min_version = \"2.4.0\" }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># min_version = \"v0.23.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">variables</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PB_ADMIN_EMAIL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">type = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">editable = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefill = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"account_email\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">credential = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">group = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Admin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">description = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Superuser email address.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">variables</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PB_ADMIN_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${password:24}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">type = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">min_length = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">secret = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">credential = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">editable = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rotatable = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">group = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Admin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">description = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Superuser password.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">domains</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">service = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pocketbase\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">port = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8090</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">primary = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">https = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Tùy chọn: subdomain, path_prefix, root_redirect, paths, basic_auth, extra_domains</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">links</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Admin console\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/_/\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resources</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pocketbase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">memory_mb = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">health</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">service = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pocketbase\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/api/health\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">port = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8090</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">timeout_seconds = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">backup</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">paths = [</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pb_data\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stop = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">updates</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rollback = </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"redeploy\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # \"redeploy\" | \"restore\" | \"manual\"</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Biểu thức biến (Variable Expressions)</h2>\n<p>Giá trị trong <code>[variables.&#x3C;NAME>]</code> hỗ trợ biểu thức <code>${...}</code> (dùng <code>$$</code> cho ký tự <code>$</code> thường). Các biến được phân giải theo thứ tự phụ thuộc và giữ nguyên giá trị đã tạo khi triển khai lại:</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th align=\"left\">Biểu thức</th><th align=\"left\">Kết quả</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${password:N}</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>N</code> ký tự chữ và số ngẫu nhiên</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${base64:N}</code> / <code>${hex:N}</code></td><td align=\"left\"><code>N</code> byte ngẫu nhiên mã hóa base64 hoặc hex (<code>2N</code> ký tự)</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${uuid}</code></td><td align=\"left\">UUID ngẫu nhiên</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${jwt:SECRET_VAR:role[:issuer]}</code></td><td align=\"left\">HS256 JWT (<code>exp: +10y</code>) ký bằng biến <code>SECRET_VAR</code></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${bcrypt:VAR[:cost]}</code></td><td align=\"left\">Chuỗi băm bcrypt của <code>VAR</code> (cost mặc định <code>10</code>), tự tạo lại khi <code>VAR</code> đổi</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${opaque_key:PREFIX:NAMESPACE}</code></td><td align=\"left\">Khóa opaque có checksum (định dạng <code>sb_publishable_</code> / <code>sb_secret_</code> của Supabase)</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${signing_keys:es256[:SECRET_VAR]}</code></td><td align=\"left\">Mảng JSON gồm cặp khóa JWK ES256 (P-256) + khóa đối xứng HS256 tùy chọn</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${jwks:KEYS_VAR}</code></td><td align=\"left\">Bộ khóa xác minh JWKS (<code>{\"keys\": [...]}</code>) đã bỏ phần khóa bí mật</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${jwt_es256:KEYS_VAR:role[:issuer]}</code></td><td align=\"left\">ES256 JWT ký bằng khóa ES256 đầu tiên trong <code>KEYS_VAR</code></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${OTHER_VAR}</code></td><td align=\"left\">Giá trị của một biến khác</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${domain}</code>, <code>${url}</code></td><td align=\"left\">Tên miền ứng dụng và <code>https://&#x3C;domain></code></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${version}</code>, <code>${version_number}</code></td><td align=\"left\">Ref đã chọn và ref đã bỏ <code>source.version_prefix</code></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\"><code>${app_id}</code>, <code>${app_name}</code>, <code>${folder}</code></td><td align=\"left\">Các định danh của ứng dụng</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Biến còn hỗ trợ <code>initial_only = true</code> (khóa sau lần triển khai đầu), <code>min_version</code> (chỉ áp dụng từ phiên bản nguồn chỉ định trở lên), <code>permission</code> (quyền bổ sung để chỉnh sửa) và <code>[variables.&#x3C;NAME>.on_rotate]</code> (bước SQL tùy chọn sau khi xoay khóa).</p>\n<h2>Overlay, Cổng mở &#x26; Bảo mật</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Compose overlay:</strong> Đặt <code>overlay.yml</code> trong thư mục template để ghi đè sâu lên file compose gốc (giá trị <code>null</code> sẽ xóa khóa, ví dụ xóa service <code>traefik</code> của upstream). Hỗ trợ overlay theo phiên bản qua <code>[[overlays]]</code> và <code>min_version</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Cổng xuất bản (<code>[[ports]]</code>):</strong> Cổng host tùy chọn, tắt mặc định và do chủ sở hữu bật tại <strong>Settings → Published ports</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Cấu hình sao lưu (<code>[backup]</code>):</strong> Hỗ trợ <code>paths</code>, <code>volumes</code>, <code>stop</code> (<code>true</code>, <code>false</code> hoặc danh sách service), <code>reset</code>/<code>reset_volumes</code>, <code>[backup.database]</code> (<code>postgres</code>, <code>mysql</code>, <code>mariadb</code>, <code>sqlite</code> hoặc chiến lược plugin) và <code>[[backup.hooks]]</code> (<code>pre</code>/<code>post</code>).</li>\n<li><strong>Danh sách ngoại lệ bảo mật (<code>[security]</code>):</strong> Mọi đặc quyền đều tắt mặc định. Nếu template cần ngoại lệ (<code>cap_add</code>, <code>host_paths</code>, <code>external</code>, ...), bắt buộc phải điền trường <code>reason</code> để hiển thị cảnh báo xác nhận cho người dùng.</li>\n<li><strong>Đa ngôn ngữ:</strong> Chuỗi văn bản trong template chỉ viết bằng tiếng Anh thuần, không chứa <code>{</code> hay <code>}</code>; lệnh <code>bun run i18n:extract</code> sẽ tự trích xuất vào catalog Lingui qua <code>scripts/lingui/template-extractor.ts</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Kiểm thử Template</h2>\n<p>Mỗi template cần có fixture offline tại <code>src/server/services/templates/__fixtures__/templates/&#x3C;id>/</code> (<code>meta.json</code> cùng <code>upstream/</code> hoặc <code>spec.json</code>). Chạy <code>bun run test</code> để thực thi <code>shipped-templates.test.ts</code> kiểm tra biên dịch, chính sách bảo mật và snapshot.</p>"